// A profile that builds houses beyond their own capacity. A level-1 house
// holds 4 residents (the first level of rules.house_levels), so a profile born
// at 6 would produce a house the rest of the game cannot represent: since phase
// 13, residents <= max_residents(level) is assumed everywhere.
//
// The second profile is at the limit and legitimate: it is what makes the error
// attributable to the first one alone.
(
    profiles: [
        (id: "impossible", starting_residents_per_house: 6),
        (id: "easy",       starting_residents_per_house: 4),
    ],
)
